  <ProfessionalSummary>覆盖冷却水泵机械密封可更换性要求，确保无需拆卸泵体即可更换密封，并设计专用工具接口。</ProfessionalSummary>
  <EngineeringRequirements count="2">
    <Requirement id="ER-P072-01" level="1" requirementType="maintainability">
      <sysml:Name>冷却水泵机械密封可更换性</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>冷却水泵应采用背抽式（back-pull-out）设计，使机械密封可在不拆卸泵体的情况下进行更换。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="inspection" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P072" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-MAINT-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-MAINT-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>机械密封更换需拆卸泵体，增加维修时间和人力成本，可能导致系统停机时间延长。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查泵的供应商图纸，确认泵体结构为背抽式设计，机械密封可从泵后端抽出更换。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>现场验证：模拟机械密封更换操作，确认无需拆卸泵体即可完成。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【冷却水泵机械密封可更换性】，来自原始需求「在不拆卸泵体的情况下完成」。E-SUPP-MAINT-002（S73 Marine Cooling System Modular Maintenance Design Practice）直接支撑了背抽式设计支持就地更换机械密封的要求；E-SUPP-MAINT-001（DNV Rules）间接支撑了泵的可拆卸性，但未明确机械密封在线更换。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
      <sysml:QualityGateReport passed="true" score="1.0">
        <Check dimension="evidence_sufficiency" passed="true" severity="error">
          <Message>Evidence present: 2 item(s), support_status='verified_by_direct_evidence'.</Message>
